 Officer Admit Card 2026 be released?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The admit card is usually released a few days before the examination date. Candidates should regularly check the official website for updates.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Where can candidates <strong>download the admit card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Candidates can download it from the official MPESB website under the <strong data-end=\"639\" data-start=\"607\">Admit Card / Test Admit Card</strong> section.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Is it mandatory to carry the <strong>admit card to the exam centre?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, carrying a printed copy of the admit card is mandatory. Without it, entry to the exam hall is not allowed.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website of the <strong>MPESB</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website of the <strong>MPESB </strong>is <strong>https://esb.mp.gov.in/e_default.html</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"MPESB ITI Training Officer Admit Card 2026\" class=\"size-full wp-image-30663 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/maxresdefault-16-1024x576-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/maxresdefault-16-1024x576-1.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-conten